[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5385008114","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122707#issuecomment-5385008114","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122707","id":5385008114,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQPiz8g","user":{"login":"billuo","id":43804776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODA0Nzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43804776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo","html_url":"https://github.com/billuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-23T08:14:35Z","updated_at":"2026-08-23T08:17:12Z","body":"I'm a bit confused; what's the expected behaviour of running the empty scene in headless mode? And how is running the script instead different? I mean, a million iterations is a lot, and will always take a long time to finish.\n\nIf I have to guess: you expect the engine to run \"full speed\" - as in FPS uncapped - in headless mode, but it's not doing that, unless you specify `--script xxx.gd`? In that case, _I can reproduce the first half of the problem._ I disabled vsync in the ProjectSettings, then tried different headless mode command lines, but **none** of them is running with FPS uncapped:\n- `godot --headless --quit-after 1000`\n- `godot --headless --quit-after 1000 --script override.gd` (the SceneTree override script as described)\n- `godot --headless --quit-after 1000 --disable-vsync`\n- `godot --headless --quit-after 1000 --disable-vsync --max-fps 0`\n- `godot --headless --quit-after 1000 --disable-vsync --max-fps 0 --script override.gd`\n\nFor me, the only way to run the project full speed is to ditch headless mode and run the project from command line normally with:\n- `godot --quit-after 1000`\n- `godot --quit-after 1000 --display-driver windows`\n- `godot --quit-after 1000 --display-driver windows --audio-driver Dummy`\n\nConsidering how `--headless` is just a shorthand for `--display-driver headless --audio-driver Dummy`, maybe the problem is actually headless display driver not respecting vsync being disabled?\n\nEDIT: the MRP I used: \n[122707-headless-mode-stall.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31345220/122707-headless-mode-stall.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5385008114/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5394368583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122707#issuecomment-5394368583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122707","id":5394368583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQYeIRw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T11:09:26Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T11:09:58Z","body":"@Myrddinarfol did you use AI to write this issue report?\n\nAlso does this happen in 4.7.2 or 4.8.dev3?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5394368583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5457630532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122707#issuecomment-5457630532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122707","id":5457630532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRUzVRA","user":{"login":"Myrddinarfol","id":185243483,"node_id":"U_kgDOCwqXWw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185243483?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Myrddinarfol","html_url":"https://github.com/Myrddinarfol","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Myrddinarfol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Myrddinarfol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Myrddinarfol/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Myrddinarfol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Myrddinarfol/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Myrddinarfol/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Myrddinarfol/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Myrddinarfol/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Myrddinarfol/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-28T20:51:27Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T20:51:27Z","body":"Hi, thanks for the feedback.\n\nYes, I used Claude Code to help investigate the issue and write the report. I’m a beginner Godot developer and English is not my native language, so I relied on it quite a lot.\n\nMy original goal was simply to build automated balance and stress tests for my game, ideally running without a normal window and faster than real time. Claude observed what looked like a slowdown after around 30 seconds, reduced the problem to an empty scene, and concluded it might be related to Godot’s headless mode.\n\nAfter reading your reply, I think we may have mixed up two different things: headless mode not running uncapped, and an actual progressive slowdown/stall.\n\nI don’t want to waste your time investigating something that may just be expected behaviour. I’ll first verify the exact Godot executable/version used for the reproduction, then retest with objective measurements such as wall-clock time, frame count and simulated time.\n\nIf I can’t reproduce a real degradation over time, the issue can be closed.\n\nThanks again for taking the time to look into this, and sorry for the confusion.\n\n(English assisted by AI.)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5457630532/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5476698794","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122707#issuecomment-5476698794","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin